{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_lava2_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_lava2_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"我们都一样","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"为了了解身为萨卡兹的父母在维多利亚的新家过得怎么样，炎熔暗自观察周围邻居，却遇上了管她叫“魔鬼”的小孩。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_lava2_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["芙蓉","炎熔","邻居A","邻居B","好奇的孩子","伊尔莎","西奥","担忧的路人","小孩们","萝丝","伊尔莎&萝丝","胆怯的小病人","伊尔莎的母亲"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"sticker","id":10,"multi":"true","text":"爸爸妈妈：","x":"180","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"1000","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":11,"multi":"true","text":"\\n你们收到这封信的时候，我和姐姐已经在过来看你们的路上了，不用再写信来阻拦，写了我们也收不到的。","x":"380","y":"170","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":12,"multi":"true","text":"\\n就算你们不肯承认，我也知道你们临时又要搬家是什么缘故。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":13,"multi":"true","text":"\\n你们说战争已结束很久，小村又偏远，村里人对萨卡兹的包容度会高些，但维多利亚真的还有那样的地方吗？","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":14,"multi":"true","text":"\\n况且，伦蒂尼姆打起来之后，你们也是报喜不报忧的，所以你们现在是不是真的过得好、有没有受欺负，我们要来亲眼确认。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":15,"multi":"true","text":"\\n总之，有事见面聊。你们一定要照顾好自己。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":16,"multi":"true","text":"炎熔","x":"180","y":"520","alignment":"right","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":17},{"type":"sticker","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"小炎熔，辣椒粉找到了吗？再不腌肉，晚饭可就来不及做了......","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"别催，反正他们回家之前做完不就行了。他们箱子里的东西怎么这么多......","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"竖琴？我怎么不知道他们懂音乐。","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"那是他们最好的朋友巴洛克先生的，好像自从战争开始之后，他们就没再联络上他了。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......呃，怎么还有我们小时候的作业本！要不扔了吧......","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"这可不行，我们两个常年不在家，妈妈总是会翻看的。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"有什么好看的，我们又不是不回来......还有这一大堆相簿，好！重！","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"这些......都是他们在伦蒂尼姆工作的时候拍的吗？都是些不认识的家伙......看穿着，好像是他们的同事。每一张都保存得好完整。","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"下面，全是书信。真是的，搬了那么多次家，这些东西早该扔了吧......乱七八糟的。","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"毕竟这里面是爸爸妈妈大半辈子的家当了......也不是一时半会儿能整理完的，谁能那么容易就把自己的人生整理清楚呢？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"更何况他们白天还要出门工作......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":42},{"type":"charslot","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"不在这里，也不在这里......架子上呢？咦......","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","duration":"1","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......芙蓉，你看这个。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"招工启事......打字员、园丁、育儿员......还都打上了叉。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"他们以前可是工程师啊......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#4","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"就算这样也一定要住在维多利亚吗......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"离开了这里，他们又能去哪里呢？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"小炎熔，把报纸放回原处去，当着他们的面可不要提。我们......做我们做得到的事就好。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......找不到辣椒粉，我去问邻居借。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":62},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"等等——就这么气冲冲地跑出去了......还没嘱咐她千万不能和邻居吵架......","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":71},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"character","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"你好，我住在东边最后一栋。请问，能不能借用一点......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居A","text":"呃......很抱歉，没有。对不起。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"（甚至不愿意听我说完......）","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":95},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"character","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"你好，我想借用一点辣椒粉。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"charslot","id":108},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"对方干脆地关上了门。","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"（包容......吗？）","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":118},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":121},{"type":"character","id":122},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"你好，我是住在......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居B","text":"我知道。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"呃......","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_243","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"一个好奇的孩子从母亲的身后探出头来，偷看来访的萨卡兹女孩。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_243","focus":"l","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居B","text":"伊尔莎，回房间去。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"我们刚搬过来不久......","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居B","text":"知道。你把附近邻居的门都敲了一遍，有事吗？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"我姐做饭找不到辣椒粉，可以借一点吗？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居B","text":"......就为这个，请在门口稍等一下。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"character","id":151},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"text","text":"门合上，又轻轻打开。一颗好奇的小脑袋探出来，盯着炎熔看——具体来说，是盯着炎熔头上的角看。","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"孩子有些紧张地吞了口口水，犹豫许久，向炎熔伸出手来。","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"炎熔一路过来早已习惯了这样的目光，站着没有动。那个女孩的小手指一点点靠近，触碰到了炎熔的衣角。","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的孩子","text":"哇——是真的衣服，不是巫术变的。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#4","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"哈？","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"charslot","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ceramicrack","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居B","text":"伊尔莎！你给我过来！","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"charslot","id":167},{"type":"text","text":"那位母亲扔下了手里的东西，冲过来将她的孩子护在身后。她脸上的神情终于不再冷静。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"邻居B","text":"我家没有你要的东西，你走吧。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":182,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"窸窸窣窣，伊尔莎从阁楼窗户爬到屋外，兴奋地向好友们打暗号。不一会儿，村子里的人们纷纷停下脚步，远远观望那诡异的场景——","id":183},{"type":"text","text":"一个不受欢迎的萨卡兹冷着脸走在他们的村子里，她身后不远处，一群小孩蹑手蹑脚地跟着她。","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"那群小孩一会儿躲在灌木丛后，一会儿纷纷打个滚闪身躲到树后，互相眨眼睛、打暗号，并时不时对着手里想象中的对讲机说话。","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"报告，魔鬼已经到了汤姆家的草垛前，马上就要走到他家门口。完毕！","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"收到，城防炮已就位！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的路人","text":"小朋友们，不要把弹弓对着那人，你们这样很危险......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"charslot","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"一旦有成人干涉，孩子们便如羽兽般尖叫着散去，但不一会儿，便又聚集起来。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"啧。你们......","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小孩们","text":"不好，魔鬼发现我们了！快撤退！","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"魔鬼......？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"（烦人，赶紧把他们吓跑吧。）","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"1","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"你们快看，魔鬼走过的那条路，地上有亮亮的脚印，那是什么？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"待着别动，我去侦察——哇哇哇，是火！魔鬼走过的路会着火！","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"我看看——是真的！地上的脚印都着火了，太厉害了！","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"呀，她走远了，快追！","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#4","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"（怎么，这还吓不走你们？）","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"炎熔盯着他们手里的弹弓看了片刻。","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"哼，算了。省得伤到你们惹麻烦。来点更厉害的让你们瞧瞧。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#2","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"啊嚏——","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"1","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"魔鬼打喷嚏喷出火了！呜哇，魔鬼长出火焰翅膀了！","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎&萝丝","text":"哇——！好......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎&萝丝","text":"好酷！","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#3","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......还挺有眼光嘛，小孩。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"1","fadetime":"0","id":243},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesinpatientcenter.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆怯的小病人","text":"（不住抽泣）","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1456_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"呃......","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"炎熔抓耳挠腮，摸摸口袋，想掏出点糖果哄小孩，又想起芙蓉叮嘱过，孩子们需要空腹抽血。","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"可恶的老姐，把自己叫过来帮忙，说什么看到有同族在，这些刚在战争中失去了父母的孩子就不会那么害怕，明明还是一直哭啊！","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"病房里此起彼伏的哭声使她手足无措。每一天，每一天，只要战争还在持续，这样的哭声便不会停止。","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"嗯......你们，想看烟花吗？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆怯的小病人","text":"（抽泣）","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1456_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"那我就当是想了。看仔细了，机会只有一次啊。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"咳咳。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#2","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"火焰啊，照耀这片大地吧！","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"0.7","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firemagic_explosion","volume":"1","delay":"1.2","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":270},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"一朵火焰形成的烟花直蹿上天花板，在病房上空炸开。炎熔偷看那些孩子的表情。他们被火焰吸引，有那么一瞬间忘记了哭泣。","id":273},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"然后，火焰触发了消防装置，把众人浇得狼狈不堪。病房里的哭声，短暂地，被笑声取代了。","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"果然哪里的小孩子都一样，一点小伎俩就能骗到。","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"哪里的......都一样吗？","id":280},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":282},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":286},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":289},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":290,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"小炎熔，你回来了。周围邻居怎么样？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"邻居？我不是去借辣椒粉的吗......","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"观察了一圈，你还放心吗？没和别人吵起来吧？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"都说我是去借辣椒粉的了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"小炎熔？你在找什么？门外那些小家伙是你新交的朋友吗？你还是那么会逗小朋友——","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芙蓉","text":"咦，带着一大包东西......出门了？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_1024_hbisc2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":311},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"报告，魔鬼从屋里出来了！现在到达了小花园，完毕。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"1","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"哇！火！我是说魔、魔鬼操纵火焰......烧断了树干！报告，魔鬼在用大量的树枝搭建一个可疑的巨大的东西。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"什么巨大的东西，说清楚！","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"我看不懂！报告，魔鬼现在抖开了一张白色床单......不对，是白色巫术材料，将它展开在树枝上，请求情报人员分析！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"情报人员到！唔，依我看，这一定是......某种危险的祭坛。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"没错，以树枝支撑帷幕，看，她把倒下的树干推过来了，那是用来放置祭品的祭品台。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"（倒吸一口气）村子有危险！","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"（瑟缩）","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"胆、胆小鬼！我们得看好她，保护我们的村子！","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"慢着！魔鬼拿出了新东西！一种机械装置，好像是个......投影仪？不对，一定是用来施放巫术的装置！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":347},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":349},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CF/Avg_ac6_6.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"话音刚落，随着仪器开启，白色“巫术材料”上出现了一只比高楼还巨大的、怒吼的巨兽。","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小孩们","text":"呀——！","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.25","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"轰！啪！","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"“巫术材料”上映出的画面里，变异的巨兽瞬间将高楼大厦践踏为齑粉，绝望的人们哭泣奔逃着，期待英雄的登场。","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"炎熔，罗德岛精英干员，法术大师，灾害专家。此刻，城市的生存希望掌握在她的手中。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小孩们","text":"快看！英雄来了！","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"咦，打大怪兽的大英雄长得是不是和那个魔鬼......不对，和那个人......一模一样？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"image","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"炎熔大模大样地坐在孩子们口中的“祭品台”上，做出一副舒舒服服享受电影的样子——","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"她把这部还未上映的电影带在身上，本是想哄哄父母开心的。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"尽管她对那些硬加进去的夸张剧情表达过鄙夷，但看来整体效果还真不错。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"孩子们纷纷偷看她，对比着她与电影中那位英雄的长相。","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"他们听不懂炎国话，却被电影中的特效吸引，不知不觉，他们就靠得近了些，又近了些，几乎靠到了炎熔身边。","id":383},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":388},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1011_purgatory_1#3","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"（哼，算你们有眼光，那就给你们看点真家伙——）","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_char_1011_purgatory_1-3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"糟糕，大怪兽要把房子踩扁了，英雄快逃！","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"英雄是不会逃的，看，她要发射火焰了！","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"嘿......你们两个，她、她呢？","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"啊啊啊大怪兽要追上来了！","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"嘿！嘿！她、她不见啦！那个人，我们的邻居......","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"啊！那个人，她刚刚还坐在这里的，去哪里了？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","volume":"0.7","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firemagic_explosion","volume":"1","delay":"1.2","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"炎熔原本坐着的地方不知何时已空无一人。突然，一条火焰从他们的身后袭来，射向了那块床单做的幕布。孩子们尖叫起来。","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"我说，这......这不会真的是祭坛吧，我们被骗上来了！","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"快跑......快......啊！","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"charslot","id":420},{"type":"text","text":"但孩子们却止住了脚步，被眼前的场景惊得忘了言语。","id":421},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2050_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"在他们眼前的，是一位换上了战斗服的、英姿飒爽的女子。她帅气而冷酷地挥手，火焰扑向了“巫术材料”，或者说，床单做成的幕布。","id":425},{"type":"text","text":"幕布上的巨兽痛苦地嚎叫着，被烧为灰烬。而后火焰熄灭，没有伤到周围的花草半分。","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小孩们","text":"哇——","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"好厉害啊！英雄，你真的打过大怪兽吗？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西奥","text":"刚才那招，能不能教我？","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萝丝","text":"你的战斗服真好看，我是说，真帅！","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"英雄英雄，我先问的，先回答我——啊！......妈妈？","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"charslot","id":438},{"type":"text","text":"当电影在火焰中落幕，孩子们才察觉到自己的家长早已在不远处紧张地盯着他们。家长们上前，不由分说地将他们的孩子往家里拽。","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎的母亲","text":"伊尔莎，跟你说过不准偷跑出来的，你今晚好好在房间里反省。","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎","text":"别拽我呀妈妈，我跟你说，刚才我看到了很厉害的......","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊尔莎的母亲","text":"不许说了。","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2050_1#1$1","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_2050_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2050_1#1$1","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"跑这么快，我又不比你们多一对獠牙、一双翅膀......","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_2050_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2050_1#1$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"算了，跑光了也就清净了。省得哄小孩子，吵吵闹闹烦死人。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_2050_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":452},{"type":"charslot","id":453},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"这是......？","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎熔","text":"......","id":456},{"type":"dialog","id":457},{"type":"charslot","id":458},{"type":"text","text":"在伊尔莎原本坐着的地方，静静地放着一瓶辣椒粉。炎熔愣了片刻，想抬头喊出感谢，但那些人早已走得不见了踪影。","id":459},{"type":"text","text":"于是，她收拾起东西往家里走，步子松快了一些。","id":460},{"type":"dialog","id":461},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":462},{"type":"dialog","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":466},{"type":"character","id":467},{"type":"image","id":468}],"characters":["芙蓉","炎熔","邻居A","邻居B","好奇的孩子","伊尔莎","西奥","担忧的路人","小孩们","萝丝","伊尔莎&萝丝","胆怯的小病人","伊尔莎的母亲"]}